    The elements of the av1_fwd_txfm_shift_ls array point to 3-byte (global)
    arrays. It is unsafe to read from a 3-byte array using vld1_s8(), which
    reads 8 bytes.

    This bug was introduced when av1/encoder/arm/neon/av1_fwd_txfm2d_neon.c
    was added in https://aomedia-review.googlesource.com/c/aom/+/110221.
    ASan reported global-buffer-overflow errors.

